{"speciesId":258,"names":{"fr":"Gobou","es":"Mudkip","en":"Mudkip","ja":"ミズゴロウ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The fin on MUDKIP’s head acts as highly sensitive radar. Using this fin to sense movements of water and air, this POKéMON can determine what is taking place around it without using its eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"In water, MUDKIP breathes using the gills on its cheeks. If it is faced with a tight situation in battle, this POKéMON will unleash its amazing power - it can crush rocks bigger than itself."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"On land, it can powerfully lift large boulders by planting its four feet and heaving. It sleeps by burying itself in soil at the water’s edge."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its large tail fin propels it through water with powerful acceleration. It is strong in spite of its size."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its large tail fin propels it through water with powerful acceleration. It is strong in spite of its size."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its power can crush boulders. It rests by covering itself with mud at the bottom of a river."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its power can crush boulders. It rests by covering itself with mud at the bottom of a river."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il analyse le courant grâce à la nageoire sur sa tête. Il est assez fort pour soulever des rochers."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il analyse le courant grâce à la nageoire sur sa tête. Il est assez fort pour soulever des rochers."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa grande queue en forme de nageoire lui donne une puissance d’accélération incroyable. Il est très costaud malgré sa taille."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene una larga cola que le propulsa por el agua con mucha potencia. A pesar de ser pequeño, tiene mucha fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its large tail fin propels it through water with powerful acceleration. It is strong in spite of its size."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大きな 尾びれで 水を かけば ぐんぐん スピードが 上がる。 小さい 体でも 力持ち。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il analyse le courant grâce à la nageoire sur sa tête. Il est assez fort pour soulever des rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La aleta de su cabeza detecta las corrientes de agua y los peligros. Tiene fuerza para levantar rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頭の ヒレで 水の 流れを 感じて まわりの 様子を 知る。 岩を 持ち上げる 力持ち。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La nageoire sur la tête de Gobou lui sert de radar hypersensible. Il l’utilise pour sentir les mouvements de l’eau et de l’air. Ainsi, ce Pokémon peut savoir ce qui se passe autour de lui sans avoir à se servir de ses yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La aleta que tiene Mudkip en la cabeza actúa de radar y es muy sensible. Puede captar movimientos que se produzcan en el agua y en el aire, y todo lo que ocurra a su alrededor, sin necesidad de abrir los ojos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The fin on Mudkip’s head acts as highly sensitive radar. Using this fin to sense movements of water and air, this Pokémon can determine what is taking place around it without using its eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭の ひれは とても 敏感な レーダー。 水や 空気の 動きから 目を 使わずに 周りの 様子を キャッチすることが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sous l’eau, Gobou peut respirer grâce aux branchies sur ses joues. S’il se retrouve en difficulté pendant un combat, ce Pokémon déchaîne ses pouvoirs incroyables. Il peut détruire des rochers plus gros que lui."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En el agua, Mudkip usa las branquias que tiene en los mofletes para respirar. Cuando tiene que enfrentarse a una situación delicada en combate, desata una fuerza asombrosa con la que puede destruir rocas incluso mayores que él."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"In water, Mudkip breathes using the gills on its cheeks. If it is faced with a tight situation in battle, this Pokémon will unleash its amazing power—it can crush rocks bigger than itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"水中では ほっぺの エラで 呼吸する。 ピンチに なると 体より 大きな 岩を 粉々に 砕く パワーを 発揮する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":258,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",